<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts oil group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts oil group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analysts Frank Kneuttel and Christopher Stavros initiated coverage of 21 major oil companies.</p>
<p>-- Among recommendations, PaineWebber put a buy on Unocal Corp.</p>
<p>-- Rated Amerada Hess Corp, Pennzoil Co and Sun Co Inc attractive.</p>
